to write whatever you want,

00:40:18.690 --> 00:40:23.690
whatever is helpful as you go along

00:40:23.880 --> 00:40:28.680
and learn the different sections of R.

00:40:30.430 --> 00:40:33.610
You can put in whatever
comments, thoughts, ideas,

